Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.24,0:00:05.30,TL,,0,0,364,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}It's a grueling but brilliant win for Lilli Tagger.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N塔格尔苦战 赢下精彩的一役
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.55,0:00:08.88,TL,,0,0,364,,{\an2}这一次 她没能跨过最后这道关
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.88,0:00:10.78,TL,,0,0,364,,{\an2}北京时间{\fs78}10{\fs68}月{\fs78}30{\fs68}号晚上
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.78,0:00:12.36,TL,,0,0,364,,{\an2}广州{\fs78}1{\fs68}/{\fs78}4{\fs68}决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.36,0:00:16.31,TL,,0,0,364,,{\an2}施晗{\fs78}4{\fs68}比{\fs78}6{\fs68} {\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}3{\fs68} {\fs78}5{\fs68}比{\fs78}7{\fs68}惜败塔格尔
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.31,0:00:18.47,TL,,0,0,364,,{\an2}第一次走到巡回赛八强
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.47,0:00:21.24,TL,,0,0,364,,{\an2}她已经把机会握到了决胜盘
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.55,0:00:25.48,TL,,0,0,364,,{\an2}开场{\fs78}2{\fs68}比{\fs78}0{\fs68} 施晗先拿到优势
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.48,0:00:28.81,TL,,0,0,364,,{\an2}可是这一局 她又被逼到破发点
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.34,0:00:38.18,TL,,0,0,364,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Gets the break back straight away. That's some response.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N立刻完成回破 这个回应很有力
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.27,0:00:41.25,TL,,0,0,364,,{\an2}领先被追平 首盘来到{\fs78}3{\fs68}比{\fs78}3{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.25,0:00:43.46,TL,,0,0,364,,{\an2}施晗仍在底线咬住相持
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.46,0:00:45.56,TL,,0,0,364,,{\an2}双方都不肯先松手
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.27,0:00:50.42,TL,,0,0,364,,{\an2}施晗贴着底线左右移动 反手顶回去
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.42,0:00:53.08,TL,,0,0,364,,{\an2}再用正手把球送向另一侧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.08,0:00:55.36,TL,,0,0,364,,{\an2}对手也始终没有退
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.06,0:01:08.24,TL,,0,0,364,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Oh yes, that's a beauty.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N好球 这一拍真漂亮
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.67,0:01:10.35,TL,,0,0,364,,{\an2}首盘{\fs78}4{\fs68}比{\fs78}6{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.35,0:01:12.24,TL,,0,0,364,,{\an2}第二盘又是{\fs78}0{\fs68}比{\fs78}2{\fs68}落后
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.24,0:01:14.29,TL,,0,0,364,,{\an2}施晗没有让比赛这样滑走
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.29,0:01:17.09,TL,,0,0,364,,{\an2}她追上来 再把主动拿回来
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.67,0:01:21.11,TL,,0,0,364,,{\an2}{\fs78}1{\fs68}比{\fs78}2{\fs68} 施晗拿到破发点
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.11,0:01:24.62,TL,,0,0,364,,{\an2}她用反手打出角度 把比分追回来
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.98,0:01:31.26,TL,,0,0,364,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Oh, what a backhand!{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这一拍反手 太精彩了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.50,0:01:33.90,TL,,0,0,364,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Just unleashes on the ball.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N迎着来球 充分释放力量
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.07,0:01:35.32,TL,,0,0,364,,{\an2}{\fs78}4{\fs68}比{\fs78}3{\fs68}领先后
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.32,0:01:37.36,TL,,0,0,364,,{\an2}她继续把塔格尔调向两侧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.36,0:01:40.24,TL,,0,0,364,,{\an2}等到机会 再把球送进空当
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.98,0:01:52.02,TL,,0,0,364,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Just working Tagger over side to side.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N不断把塔格尔 调向球场两侧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.12,0:01:56.88,TL,,0,0,364,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}What a recovery!{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N多精彩的挽回
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.23,0:01:59.79,TL,,0,0,364,,{\an2}{\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}3{\fs68} 一盘一盘拿回来
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.79,0:02:01.94,TL,,0,0,364,,{\an2}决胜盘 她先守住长局
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.94,0:02:04.43,TL,,0,0,364,,{\an2}又在{\fs78}1{\fs68}比{\fs78}1{\fs68}时争到破发机会
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.43,0:02:06.73,TL,,0,0,364,,{\an2}这次反手再添一分
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.23,0:02:10.47,TL,,0,0,364,,{\an2}{\fs78}1{\fs68}比{\fs78}1{\fs68} {\fs78}15{\fs68}比{\fs78}40{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.47,0:02:12.72,TL,,0,0,364,,{\an2}施晗先用反手压住对手
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.72,0:02:15.40,TL,,0,0,364,,{\an2}再把这次机会打成领先
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.96,0:02:25.90,TL,,0,0,364,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}That's more sensational tennis from Shi.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N施晗 又打出了精彩的网球
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.03,0:02:28.74,TL,,0,0,364,,{\an2}随后 她把比分带到{\fs78}4{\fs68}比{\fs78}2{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.74,0:02:30.40,TL,,0,0,364,,{\an2}但塔格尔连追{\fs78}3{\fs68}局
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.40,0:02:31.95,TL,,0,0,364,,{\an2}领先变成{\fs78}4{\fs68}比{\fs78}5{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.95,0:02:35.22,TL,,0,0,364,,{\an2}施晗又被推到必须守住的关头
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.03,0:02:39.52,TL,,0,0,364,,{\an2}{\fs78}4{\fs68}比{\fs78}5{\fs68} 对手拿到赛点
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.52,0:02:41.02,TL,,0,0,364,,{\an2}她仍然顶住相持
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.02,0:02:44.06,TL,,0,0,364,,{\an2}把球打回去 机会还没有结束
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.16,0:02:50.20,TL,,0,0,364,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Simplifies the sport.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这一拍 让一切简单了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.81,0:02:54.94,TL,,0,0,364,,{\an2}第一个赛点 她救了回来 {\fs78}5{\fs68}比{\fs78}5{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.94,0:02:57.23,TL,,0,0,364,,{\an2}但到了{\fs78}5{\fs68}比{\fs78}6{\fs68} 自己的发球局
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.23,0:03:00.16,TL,,0,0,364,,{\an2}她仍然没能把比赛带进抢七
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.81,0:03:04.52,TL,,0,0,364,,{\an2}{\fs78}5{\fs68}比{\fs78}6{\fs68} 施晗拿到保发机会
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.52,0:03:06.65,TL,,0,0,364,,{\an2}双方在底线来回调动
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.65,0:03:09.75,TL,,0,0,364,,{\an2}她还在用正反手争取这一局
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.60,0:03:33.56,TL,,0,0,364,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}That's monstrous hitting.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这几拍 击球力量惊人
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.44,0:03:49.50,TL,,0,0,364,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}It's a grueling but brilliant win for Lilli Tagger.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N塔格尔苦战 赢下精彩的一役
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.26,0:03:55.52,TL,,0,0,364,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}There will be two teenagers in the semifinals of Guangzhou.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N{\fs78}2{\fs68}位十几岁球员 将亮相广州半决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.86,0:03:59.64,TL,,0,0,364,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}What a match! Finally comes through.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N多精彩的一战 终于闯过这一关
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.93,0:04:03.67,TL,,0,0,364,,{\an2}施晗打出{\fs78}26{\fs68}个制胜分 比对手更多
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.67,0:04:05.80,TL,,0,0,364,,{\an2}但{\fs78}58{\fs68}次非受迫性失误
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.80,0:04:07.97,TL,,0,0,364,,{\an2}决胜盘就有{\fs78}35{\fs68}次
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.97,0:04:09.27,TL,,0,0,364,,{\an2}她打出了冲击力
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.27,0:04:11.91,TL,,0,0,364,,{\an2}也为不稳定付出了代价
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.93,0:04:16.10,TL,,0,0,364,,{\an2}走到网前 握手告别
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.10,0:04:18.51,TL,,0,0,364,,{\an2}这趟广州之旅结束了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.51,0:04:19.49,TL,,0,0,364,,{\an2}遗憾很重
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.49,0:04:22.09,TL,,0,0,364,,{\an2}第一次巡回赛八强也是真的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.09,0:04:25.36,TL,,0,0,364,,{\an2}愿施晗带着这些好球继续往前走
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.36,0:04:27.03,TL,,0,0,364,,{\an2}下一次握住领先
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.03,0:04:30.35,TL,,0,0,364,,{\an2}你最期待她把哪一个环节练得更稳？
